Actually, you know what — let's look at it from the "what does the user actually do" angle:
1. Move a component: press, move, release in empty space. (Most common)
2. Draw an arrow A→B: press on A, move to B, release on B. (Core wiring)
3. Draw an arrow from A to empty space (annotation line): press on A, move, release in empty space. → Ambiguous with 1!

